@startuml rich-sell-sequence
!include ../../sellStocks/diagrams/sell-style.puml
title A sale delegates business decisions
caption Main baseline — storage and quote calls omitted
participant "Application service" as S
participant "Portfolio" as P
participant "Holding" as H
participant "Lot" as L
S -> P: sell(ticker, quantity, price)
P -> P: Check quantity and locate holding
P -> H: sell(quantity, price)
H -> H: Verify sufficient shares
loop Consume oldest lots until fulfilled
 H -> L: Read cost and reduce quantity
 H -> H: Remove depleted lots
end
H --> P: SellResult
P -> P: Credit proceeds
P --> S: SellResult
note over S
Then persist the portfolio
and sale transaction.
end note
@enduml
